"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1562353-faq-on-6th-edition?p=1563877#post1563877\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, Werewolf didn't stop them before, so I'd say if they want to focus on street level they'll just butcher things again.<br /> <br /> But given the Playtest has rules for Methuselah I think we can hope they'll be more sensible in this regard.</div> </div> </div> </div>Honstly I wonder how they could overcorrect from W5.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25848-mrornx","name":"MrornX","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"418"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-06T22:54:02-07:00","id":1563883,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GreatHornedRatkin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1562353-faq-on-6th-edition?p=1563878#post1563878\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oohoo, playing a Methuselah sounds fun!<br /> <br /> I knew about them bringing back Elders, but didn't expect ancients as well.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, it's not terribly powerful, but that's just because it's a Playtest with limited options, so only powers up to level 3, a few Merits rather than full selection and so on.<br /> <br /> But the basic rules for Methuselah are explicitly there and usable.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-07T02:18:41-07:00","id":1563884,"title":"","content":"So heard some hearsay that apparently the Neo-Giovanni maybe flipped to the Sabbat or at the very open to working with them. Something to do with The Promise of 1528 ending in 2028 and the Sabbat &quot;embracing new tactics&quot;, like economic warfare. Nothing solid beyond that. Can any lore expert verify that?<br /> <br /> Edit: Before you ask my only source is a reddit post about half-remembered conversation with a V6 dev at a Q&amp;A event giving a non answer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25848,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25848-mrornx","user":"MrornX","date":". 09-07-2026, 06:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude02","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25848-mrornx","name":"MrornX","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"418"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-07T02:30:02-07:00","id":1563885,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GreatHornedRatkin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1562353-faq-on-6th-edition?p=1563878#post1563878\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oohoo, playing a Methuselah sounds fun!<br /> <br /> I knew about them bringing back Elders, but didn't expect ancients as well.</div> </div> </div> </div> Technically they weren't sort of included as a tier, but the rules for Gen 5 and 4 -ARE- there. Officially the highest tier of play was Gen 7 and 6. You just have everything you need to do them within the constraints of the playtest material. Also as a forever DM/ST who's had the honour of RPing a range of characters, old vamps can indeed be very fun to toy with.<br /> <br /> Granted I'm the kind of person who gets lost in worldbuilding, writing backstories and roleplaying out all sorts of individual provided my red lines aren't crossed. Though when I write short fics, it tends to touch on dark subjects because I like touching on historical issues, events and such. Its fun seeing how such things impacted someone as they lived (or unlived in this case) through it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13674-amalasuintha","name":"Amalasuintha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13674_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"123"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-07T03:38:44-07:00","id":1563888,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amalasuintha</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1562353-faq-on-6th-edition?p=1563885#post1563885\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Technically they weren't sort of included as a tier, but the rules for Gen 5 and 4 -ARE- there. Officially the highest tier of play was Gen 7 and 6. You just have everything you need to do them within the constraints of the playtest material. Also as a forever DM/ST who's had the honour of RPing a range of characters, old vamps can indeed be very fun to toy with.<br /> <br /> Granted I'm the kind of person who gets lost in worldbuilding, writing backstories and roleplaying out all sorts of individual provided my red lines aren't crossed. Though when I write short fics, it tends to touch on dark subjects because I like touching on historical issues, events and such. Its fun seeing how such things impacted someone as they lived (or unlived in this case) through it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Personally, I think the idea of our methuselahs siring childer in the modern nights would be a very intriguing prospect to explore.<br /> <br /> Like, how does the creation of a new 5th - 6th generation vampire within the last 20 years affect both vampire and mortal society?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29027-greathornedratkin","name":"GreatHornedRatkin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29027_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2026"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"413"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-07T03:48:48-07:00","id":1563889,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrornX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1562353-faq-on-6th-edition?p=1563880#post1563880\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Honstly I wonder how they could overcorrect from W5.</div> </div> </div> </div>They already said W5 was a reboot to the setting. Just reboot the reboot. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude02","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29027-greathornedratkin","name":"GreatHornedRatkin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29027_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2026"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"413"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-07T05:57:19-07:00","id":1563890,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GreatHornedRatkin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1562353-faq-on-6th-edition?p=1563889#post1563889\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They already said W5 was a reboot to the setting. Just reboot the reboot. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Eh I was thinking the fulff taking garou fuck yeah to a uncomfortable degree. Like the war of rage is tragic but in the long run nesscary degree.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25848-mrornx","name":"MrornX","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"418"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-07T07:48:52-07:00","id":1563891,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrornX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1562353-faq-on-6th-edition?p=1563890#post1563890\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Eh I was thinking the fulff taking garou fuck yeah to a uncomfortable degree. Like the war of rage is tragic but in the long run nesscary degree.</div> </div> </div> </div>It most certainly was not!<br /> <br /> Gaia gave everybody their own designated roles to fulfill, and the Garou erroneously believed they knew how to do everyone's role better than them.<br /> <br /> Stupid mutts can't even figure out how to do their own role properly; what made them think they had any right to exert authority over the other Fera!?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude02","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29027-greathornedratkin","name":"GreatHornedRatkin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29027_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2026"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"413"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-07T07:51:20-07:00","id":1563892,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrornX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1562353-faq-on-6th-edition?p=1563884#post1563884\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So heard some hearsay that apparently the Neo-Giovanni maybe flipped to the Sabbat or at the very open to working with them. Something to do with The Promise of 1528 ending in 2028 and the Sabbat &quot;embracing new tactics&quot;, like economic warfare. Nothing solid beyond that. Can any lore expert verify that?<br /> <br /> Edit: Before you ask my only source is a reddit post about half-remembered conversation with a V6 dev at a Q&amp;A event giving a non answer.</div> </div> </div> </div>That has nothing to do with being a lore expert, just if something new surfaced.<br /> <br /> Which I don't think it has, and it would have been useful if you could link your source, as sometimes analyzing the source is informative.<br /> <br /> But overall I doubt there's anything.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrornX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1562353-faq-on-6th-edition?p=1563890#post1563890\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Eh I was thinking the fulff taking garou fuck yeah to a uncomfortable degree. Like the war of rage is tragic but in the long run nesscary degree.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is there any reason you're thinking about this?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-07T09:07:32-07:00","id":1563894,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GreatHornedRatkin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1562353-faq-on-6th-edition?p=1563888#post1563888\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Personally, I think the idea of our methuselahs siring childer in the modern nights would be a very intriguing prospect to explore.<br /> <br /> Like, how does the creation of a new 5th - 6th generation vampire within the last 20 years affect both vampire and mortal society?</div> </div> </div> </div>The thought of this makes me lick my chops. Think of it: in the chaos of recent years, turnover and mortality rates create openings that some ancient monster has to fill in order to keep her empire running. You were chosen. You've got the potential of a god in you, if you ever live long enough to develop into it, but you're in impossible position. A monster who doesn't understand the limits of what can be done with a cell phone and who probably developed an addiction to diablerie to weather the Beckoning demands that you protect what she's built from ancillae who understand the modern world as well as you do, and who have the advantage of years of experience as undead.<br /> <br /> Or imagine the fledgling with a methusaleh's blood in them as a Storyteller character, a Kindreed Gul Dukat, starting the chronicle looking untouchable and coming back a little more pathetic, a little more desperate, having a little bit less to lose, every time he survives being foiled by the players.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-07T09:14:49-07:00","id":1563895,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Reasor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1562353-faq-on-6th-edition?p=1563894#post1563894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Or imagine the fledgling with a methusaleh's blood in them as a Storyteller character, a Kindreed Gul Dukat, starting the chronicle looking untouchable and coming back a little more pathetic, a little more desperate, having a little bit less to lose, every time he survives being foiled by the players.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not to mention if the Sabbat catch wind of what you are, they're going to be hurling themselves at you, until they finally soften you up enough to eat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29027-greathornedratkin","name":"GreatHornedRatkin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29027_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2026"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"413"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-07T09:44:16-07:00","id":1563896,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GreatHornedRatkin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1562353-faq-on-6th-edition?p=1563888#post1563888\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Personally, I think the idea of our methuselahs siring childer in the modern nights would be a very intriguing prospect to explore.<br /> <br /> Like, how does the creation of a new 5th - 6th generation vampire within the last 20 years affect both vampire and mortal society?</div> </div> </div> </div> It would depend heavily on the direction you want to go in, of which there are so many! So it comes down to your table really.<br /> <br /> For the Lolz: A brand new 4th gen of any clan. Now everyone will collectively shit their pants.<br /> For the Ultimate Lolz: A brand new 4th gen... That's a caitiff. Now the kindred will collectively shit their pants even harder because suddenly they're dealing with a complete unknown. Cue the spooky music! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13674-amalasuintha","name":"Amalasuintha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13674_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"123"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-07T09:56:53-07:00","id":1563897,"title":"","content":"Not sure. Ur-Shulgi's return wasn't exactly popular, and The Stoneman was already there as a low gen Caitiff. I'm guessing V5 didn't develop either any further?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Custom Sorcery: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1487084-pattern-weaving-ananasi-sorcery-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">For Ananasi</a> | Mortal:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1509365-hekau-for-sorcerers\" target=\"_blank\"> Hekau</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/mai