lesh revolt</i></div> </div> </div> </div>Volcanic Heartburn!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29027-greathornedratkin","name":"GreatHornedRatkin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29027_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2026"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"413"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-22T21:59:06-07:00","id":1564288,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GreatHornedRatkin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1562353-faq-on-6th-edition?p=1564287#post1564287\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Volcanic Heartburn!</div> </div> </div> </div>It's ok.<br /> <br /> Pentex has a pill for that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude02","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28924-tjalei","name":"Tjalei","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-10-02T12:07:12-07:00","id":1564488,"title":"","content":"So, new Dev Diary just dropped<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.paradoxinteractive.com/games/world-of-darkness/news/month-of-darkness-2026-day-2\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/u73tyf0fa8v1/6SK2guLFYLH8FnhJtNxmJG/ec236ccbdceca9697879a22073264d5e/worldofdarkness-top_bg_free_content.jpg?w=1200&amp;h=630&amp;fit=fill&amp;f=center\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.paradoxinteractive.com/games/world-of-darkness/news/month-of-darkness-2026-day-2\" target=\"_blank\"> Month of Darkness 2026 - Day 2 - Dev Diary #3 - Paradox Interactive </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.paradoxinteractive.com/games/world-of-darkness/news/month-of-darkness-2026-day-2\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.paradoxinteractive.com/games/world-of-darkness/news/month-of-darkness-2026-day-2 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> World of Darkness </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Main takeaways: <br /> <br /> New announcements on October 5th, hopefully some new books to keep people going until V6 releases. <br /> <br /> I am surprisingly happy with the feedback to the feedback. The truth is in the pudding but it seems that they are paying close attention to those surveys so that is all well and good. Let's see what it results in for the Alpha 2.0.<br /> <br /> Alpha 2.0 probably dropping before end of the month.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2357-sathriel","name":"sathriel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-10-02T13:56:06-07:00","id":1564491,"title":"","content":"I would almost honestly just settle for that if I take a background that gives me money, I can use that money to buy a car, if I have sufficient money for a car.(yes, this still bothers me)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","name":"MarkK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-10-02T14:55:41-07:00","id":1564492,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>sathriel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1562353-faq-on-6th-edition?p=1564488#post1564488\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, new Dev Diary just dropped<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.paradoxinteractive.com/games/world-of-darkness/news/month-of-darkness-2026-day-2\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/u73tyf0fa8v1/6SK2guLFYLH8FnhJtNxmJG/ec236ccbdceca9697879a22073264d5e/worldofdarkness-top_bg_free_content.jpg?w=1200&amp;h=630&amp;fit=fill&amp;f=center\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.paradoxinteractive.com/games/world-of-darkness/news/month-of-darkness-2026-day-2\" target=\"_blank\"> Month of Darkness 2026 - Day 2 - Dev Diary #3 - Paradox Interactive </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.paradoxinteractive.com/games/world-of-darkness/news/month-of-darkness-2026-day-2\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.paradoxinteractive.com/games/world-of-darkness/news/month-of-darkness-2026-day-2 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> World of Darkness </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Main takeaways:<br /> <br /> New announcements on October 5th, hopefully some new books to keep people going until V6 releases.<br /> <br /> I am surprisingly happy with the feedback to the feedback. The truth is in the pudding but it seems that they are paying close attention to those surveys so that is all well and good. Let's see what it results in for the Alpha 2.0.<br /> <br /> Alpha 2.0 probably dropping before end of the month.</div> </div> </div> </div> That thing has been PR filtered too much for me to take them at their word. They don't seem to understand why the vitae issue is a problem for so many for instance, which stems from it being HP and blood points combined. No amount of adjusting the costs will fix that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13674-amalasuintha","name":"Amalasuintha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13674_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"123"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-10-03T00:18:38-07:00","id":1564499,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amalasuintha</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1562353-faq-on-6th-edition?p=1564492#post1564492\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> That thing has been PR filtered too much for me to take them at their word. They don't seem to understand why the vitae issue is a problem for so many for instance, which stems from it being HP and blood points combined. No amount of adjusting the costs will fix that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Given industry standards and particularly the patterns from Paradox, I think this was actually reasonably informative and does give hope.<br /> <br /> Being PR filtered is a given. This won't go away, period, in any publicly traded company. So like it or not we have to work with this.<br /> <br /> They also specifically don't want to tell what the new mechanic for Blood will be like, which is also reasonable. Explaining part of a rule without context is a sure way to generate a ton of confusion and pointless backlash.<br /> <br /> I'm not saying they did understood, but that we can't really say much from this report because this is the expected language. All in all they at least made it clear that they:<br /> <br /> 1. Read the feedback;<br /> 2. Will change things;<br /> 3. Are going to iterate this some more.<br /> <br /> My experience is that this is about as much as you can hope to get from those reports, so it's as good as it gets.<br /> <br /> Better to wait for the actual 2.0 to see if they did understood something or not, the fact it will likely happen this month was the best part.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-10-03T02:44:09-07:00","id":1564504,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1562353-faq-on-6th-edition?p=1564499#post1564499\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Given industry standards and particularly the patterns from Paradox, I think this was actually reasonably informative and does give hope.<br /> <br /> Being PR filtered is a given. This won't go away, period, in any publicly traded company. So like it or not we have to work with this.<br /> <br /> They also specifically don't want to tell what the new mechanic for Blood will be like, which is also reasonable. Explaining part of a rule without context is a sure way to generate a ton of confusion and pointless backlash.<br /> <br /> I'm not saying they did understood, but that we can't really say much from this report because this is the expected language. All in all they at least made it clear that they:<br /> <br /> 1. Read the feedback;<br /> 2. Will change things;<br /> 3. Are going to iterate this some more.<br /> <br /> My experience is that this is about as much as you can hope to get from those reports, so it's as good as it gets.<br /> <br /> Better to wait for the actual 2.0 to see if they did understood something or not, the fact it will likely happen this month was the best part.</div> </div> </div> </div> Yeah their words are cheap. I'm waiting to see their actions at the moment. Corpos rarely give me reason to believe them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13674-amalasuintha","name":"Amalasuintha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13674_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"123"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-10-09T04:16:49-07:00","id":1564635,"title":"","content":"Yeah, the dev diary seems fine to me. It seems they're listening to people and saying all the right things. While I may not get the VTR2e rules + V20 fluff that I want, I'm not worried that they're not listening to people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}